        "original_id": "ece40c79-0b6d-5e98-8240-6b566410b0bd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yoon Sang-hyun, Lee Bo-young, Lee Jong-suk, Lee Da-hee\n- Works: Queen of Housewives, My Fair Lady, Secret Garden, I Can Hear Your Voice\n- Organizations: SBS\n- Topics: South Korean actors, singers, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Yoon Sang-hyun was born on September 21, 1973, and he is a South Korean actor and singer.\n- Yoon Sang-hyun is known for roles in the 2009 works \"Queen of Housewives\" and \"My Fair Lady.\"\n- Yoon Sang-hyun is known for roles in \"Secret Garden\" in 2011 and \"I Can Hear Your Voice\" in 2013.\n- \"I Can Hear Your Voice\" is a 2013 South Korean television series starring Lee Bo-young, Lee Jong-suk, Yoon Sang-hyun, and Lee Da-hee.\n- SBS aired \"I Can Hear Your Voice\" from June 5 to August 1, 2013, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 18 episodes.",
